{
  "name": "v3_jetfoil_graded",
  "description": "ATLAS V3 small, nose-pair battery layout (12.8 kg): graded jetfoils, the jet turned steepest at the inner station (next to the body) and least at the outer (foil end): lean inner < middle < outer, 5..35 deg in 2.5 steps, every strictly graded triple (286), then the outer station extended to 37.5-45 (42 more: middle 25-40 in 5s, inner 10/15/20) because the leaders sat at outer 35. Nose fans 30 deg as built. Each flown at trim and trim +-0.5 deg; score = mean of the three.",
